      "content": "That's a good start, but the QC bot just flagged it for \"insufficient density.\" It needs a higher organizational complexity score to clear the gate. \n\nCan you expand this into a more detailed guide? Try to increase the number of headings and bullet points so the score goes up, but please—I'm serious—make sure the information is actually useful for the techs. Don't just make a list of single words or tiny, pointless steps just to inflate the count. I need the actual technical details from the specs expanded into a proper, structured manual.",
